{"run_id": "50391dd37c2a472bb2b0af55f89aacec", "sequence": 4, "time": "2026-10-29T16:40:18.336181+00:00", "event": "tool_result", "call_id": "o01-1-0", "name": "search_documents", "observation": {"ok": true, "mode": "hybrid", "hits": [{"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c014", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r014", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第十四条 关于期限的问答"], "token_count": 217, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 323.1171875, 180.25, 334.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 349.9765625, 541.5, 377.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 541.5, 421.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十四条 关于期限的问答\n\n问：拿到发票后是否重新计算30天？答：本制度写明费用发生后30个自然日，未写明收到发票后重新起算，不能自行改变口径。问：遇到周末可否自动顺延？答：本文未规定顺延，需要补充依据。\n\n问：另一份文件规定15天，应采用哪一个？答：本制度未说明与其他制度的优先关系，也未提供范围清单。应核对双方适用范围、有效性及批准文件；不能仅以日期较新、", "rrf_score": 0.03101, "bm25_score": 3.416237, "vector_score": 0.473629}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c008", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r008", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第八条期限争议"], "token_count": 123, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [47.80028381347656, 563.172412109375, 133.24857177734376, 577.17744140625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9997422865458897}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [47.3772705078125, 590.75810546875, 540.60849609375, 621.738916015625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9992694146931171}], "snippet": "第八条期限争议\n\n如果另一制度规定30个自然日，应同时核对两份原文及适用依据。本文件没有说明哪份制度优先，不能仅凭严格程度或版本日期选择15天。对具体申请的适用制度应请求补充确认，并说明当前资料存在冲突。", "rrf_score": 0.03031, "bm25_score": 2.98286, "vector_score": 0.466426}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十三条期限问答"], "token_count": 223, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 184.18751220703126, 146.36192626953124, 195.64617919921875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9986509010195732}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 210.9244140625, 541.454541015625, 256.75908203125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9981319904327393}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 272.0373046875, 536.801416015625, 302.1693603515625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9984620551805239}], "snippet": "第十三条期限问答\n\n问：十五天是工作日吗？答：本文写的是15个自然日，包含周末与节假日。问：财务需要在15天内付款吗？答：15天是申请提交期限，本文没有规定付款时限。问：补开发票后期限重新开始吗？答：本文没有这一规定，不能自动重新起算。\n\n问：超过15天是否绝对不能报？答：本文没有规定超期处置、豁免条件和批准权限，不能推导出绝对结论。问：本制度是否只适用于某", "rrf_score": 0.030159, "bm25_score": 2.270612, "vector_score": 0.500737}, {"doc_id": "D03", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c002", "title": "年假申请流程", "topic": "年假", "scope": "全体正式员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r002", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["年假申请流程", "正文"], "token_count": 59, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D03-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D03_年假申请流程.md", "sha256": "041edf691e47cbcdc69171f784c112374b5b1f13fb3cb87501fd6c1b0c7e36be", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 15, "line_end": 15, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "紧急请假可先联系主管，再于返岗后1个工作日内补交申请。本文不规定年假天数。", "rrf_score": 0.016393, "bm25_score": 0.0, "vector_score": 0.559635}, {"doc_id": "D11", "version_date": "2026-01-05", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "快递领取规范", "topic": "快递", "scope": "总部办公区", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["快递领取规范", "正文"], "token_count": 59, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D11-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D11_快递领取规范.md", "sha256": "f05f6939113789ec6039b9b03044e9ed78fc7aa18617994111badee48dbba0e2", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 13, "line_end": 13, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "员工个人快递请在工作日18点前到一楼收发室领取，公司不承担个人快递的寄件费用。", "rrf_score": 0.016393, "bm25_score": 4.410178, "vector_score": 0.286819}, {"doc_id": "D03", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "年假申请流程", "topic": "年假", "scope": "全体正式员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["年假申请流程", "正文"], "token_count": 60, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D03-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D03_年假申请流程.md", "sha256": "041edf691e47cbcdc69171f784c112374b5b1f13fb3cb87501fd6c1b0c7e36be", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 13, "line_end": 13, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "正式员工申请年假，应至少提前3个工作日在办公系统提交申请，并由直属主管审批。", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 0.0, "vector_score": 0.544637}]}}
